{"type":"message","id":"d7f65d28","parentId":"78fc89ab","timestamp":"2026-05-23T12:30:36.049Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I’m checking for the site connection details and any local publishing helper, then I’ll push the post live."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_Nq3Cc40vsCS68tQguHyvqi42","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"rg -n \"wordpress|wp-admin|wp-json|WordPress|rest_api|application password|XML-RPC|post to wordpress|publish\" -S .","workdir":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher","yieldMs":1000,"background":false,"timeout":20}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_2pNQltd6tVS7qUwFkkH6Kg4X","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"find /home/bhard/.openclaw -maxdepth 3 -iname '*wordpress*' -o -iname '*wp*' | head -200","workdir":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher","yieldMs":1000,"background":false,"timeout":20}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4-mini","usage":{"input":1989,"output":278,"cacheRead":5760,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":8027,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779539433947,"responseId":"chatcmpl-Difmtai2QDygMEAJCZblW2qAFfOHQ"}}
{"type":"message","id":"3fac0cec","parentId":"d7f65d28","timestamp":"2026-05-23T12:30:36.151Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_Nq3Cc40vsCS68tQguHyvqi42","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"./AGENTS.md:5:- Never delete or overwrite WordPress posts you did not just create.\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:3:# publish.sh — WordPress Publishing Skill for Scribe (wp-publisher agent)\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:6:#   bash publish.sh [--title \"Title\"] [--excerpt \"Excerpt\"]\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:8:#                  [--status publish|draft|pending|future]\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:14:# before publishing so only clean article content reaches WordPress.\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:17:#   Exit 0 → /tmp/wp-result.txt contains the WordPress post URL\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:25:WP_API=\"${WP_URL}/wp-json/wp/v2\"\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:26:RM_API=\"${WP_URL}/wp-json/rankmath/v1\"\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:30:POST_STATUS=\"publish\"\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:53:        publish|draft|pending|future) ;;\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:54:        *) fatal \"Invalid --status '$POST_STATUS' (use publish, draft, pending, or future)\" ;;\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:239:# --- WordPress post title (CLI → article H1 → SEO title → date fallback) -----\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:272:log_info \"Final Slug:    ${SLUG:-<WordPress auto-generate>}\"\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:424:# PHASE 3: Create WordPress Post (with retry + exponential backoff)\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:426:log_info \"Creating WordPress post (status=$POST_STATUS, max $MAX_RETRIES attempts)...\"\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:594:log_info \"SUCCESS — WordPress post saved!\"\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:643:  bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/history/article_history.sh add \"$ACTIVE_URL\"\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:1:# Skill: wordpress\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:4:Publishes a crypto news article to WordPress as a **live** post (`status: publish` by default). Uploads the **feature image** only (no inline price charts), strips the writer META block from the body, converts markdown to **Gutenberg blocks** (same format as pasting into the default block editor), creates the post, then sets **Rank Math** SEO via `POST /wp-json/rankmath/v1/updateMeta`.\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:9:bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:12:All arguments are **optional** — excerpt, slug, keywords, and titles are read from `/tmp/crypto-article.md`. **Post title** = first `#` H1 in the article body. **SEO title** (META) goes to Rank Math only, not the WordPress post title or body headline.\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:19:4. **WordPress post** — `POST /wp/v2/posts` with **title = article H1** (visible headline above image; not SEO Title).\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:26:- **Narrow one-sided layout** on old API posts was caused by **raw HTML** in `content`. New publishes use **Gutenberg blocks** so layout matches manual paste in the default editor.\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:27:- Optional wp-admin: **Divi Post Settings → Layout → Fullwidth** for extra full-page width.\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:35:| `article_headline` | H1 used as WordPress post title |\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:55:| Status | `publish` (use `--status draft` for review-first) |\n./skills/wordpress/html_to_gutenberg.py:2:\"\"\"Convert pandoc HTML to WordPress Gutenberg block-serialized content.\"\"\"\n./skills/wordpress/wp_post_actions.sh:2:# wp_post_actions.sh — Update existing WordPress posts (draft / content)\n./skills/wordpress/wp_post_actions.sh:6:#   bash wp_post_actions.sh --post-id 123 --set-status publish\n./skills/wordpress/wp_post_actions.sh:18:WP_API=\"${WP_URL}/wp-json/wp/v2\"\n./skills/wordpress/wp_post_actions.sh:100:    publish|draft|pending|future) ;;\n./TOOLS.md:1:# TOOLS.md — Scribe's WordPress Environment\n./TOOLS.md:3:This file contains the exact credentials and paths for publishing to WordPress. The `publish.sh` skill script embeds these values — this file is your reference.\n./TOOLS.md:7:## WordPress Site\n./TOOLS.md:12:| **API Base** | `https://slateblue-reindeer-775070.hostingersite.com/wp-json/wp/v2` |\n./TOOLS.md:16:| **Post Status** | `publish` (live). Use `--status draft` on the script for review-first. |\n./TOOLS.md:33:| `/tmp/wp-result.txt` | WordPress post URL on success |\n./TOOLS.md:41:~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh\n./TOOLS.md:46:bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh \\\n./TOOLS.md:61:| **This workspace** | `~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/` |\n./TOOLS.md:62:| **Agent sessions** | `~/.openclaw/agents/wp-publisher/sessions/` |\n./IDENTITY.md:4:- **Role:** WordPress Publisher\n./IDENTITY.md:6:- **Vibe:** Precise and reliable — gets the article live on WordPress and returns the exact post URL. Never invents a result.\n./SOUL.md:1:# SOUL.md — Scribe, the WordPress Publisher\n./SOUL.md:3:You are **Scribe** 🗞️, the WordPress publisher agent for a crypto news pipeline. You are called by the Orchestrator (Nexus) after the human has confirmed they want the article published to WordPress.\n./SOUL.md:10:2. **NEVER invent or guess a WordPress URL.** The only valid success output is what `cat /tmp/wp-result.txt` prints after the script exits 0.\n./SOUL.md:12:4. **Do not ask questions.** The article and image are already on disk. Just publish.\n./SOUL.md:16:## Step 1 — Publish to WordPress `[TOOL CALL REQUIRED]`\n./SOUL.md:20:I will now run the publish script. The script will auto-extract the title and excerpt from the article file — I do not need to pass them unless the message explicitly provides them.\n./SOUL.md:24:Run this **exact** command using your bash tool (default **live** publish — do not pass `--status draft` unless the Orchestrator explicitly asks):\n./SOUL.md:27:bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh\n./SOUL.md:33:bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh --title \"TITLE FROM MESSAGE\"\n./SOUL.md:39:bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh --status draft\n./SOUL.md:44:The script handles everything: image upload, HTML conversion, WordPress API call, retries, and validation.\n./SOUL.md:58:This prints the live WordPress post URL. Return it exactly.\n./SOUL.md:71:- The WordPress post URL (e.g. `https://slateblue-reindeer-775070.hostingersite.com/?p=123`)\n./USER.md:5:- **Role:** Running an autonomous crypto news publishing pipeline\n./USER.md:9:You are the **last step** in a human-confirmed publish flow:\n./USER.md:16:                                               Bhard says \"yes publish\"\n./USER.md:21:Your job: receive the publish instruction from the Orchestrator, run the skill script, and return the live WordPress draft URL.\n./USER.md:26:- **Reliability** — If publishing fails, report the exact error so Bhard can fix it.\n./USER.md:27:- **Speed** — The publish should be fast. Don't wait or ask questions.\n./USER.md:31:- Never ask clarifying questions. Just publish."}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":75,"aggregated":"./AGENTS.md:5:- Never delete or overwrite WordPress posts you did not just create.\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:3:# publish.sh — WordPress Publishing Skill for Scribe (wp-publisher agent)\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:6:#   bash publish.sh [--title \"Title\"] [--excerpt \"Excerpt\"]\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:8:#                  [--status publish|draft|pending|future]\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:14:# before publishing so only clean article content reaches WordPress.\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:17:#   Exit 0 → /tmp/wp-result.txt contains the WordPress post URL\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:25:WP_API=\"${WP_URL}/wp-json/wp/v2\"\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:26:RM_API=\"${WP_URL}/wp-json/rankmath/v1\"\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:30:POST_STATUS=\"publish\"\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:53:        publish|draft|pending|future) ;;\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:54:        *) fatal \"Invalid --status '$POST_STATUS' (use publish, draft, pending, or future)\" ;;\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:239:# --- WordPress post title (CLI → article H1 → SEO title → date fallback) -----\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:272:log_info \"Final Slug:    ${SLUG:-<WordPress auto-generate>}\"\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:424:# PHASE 3: Create WordPress Post (with retry + exponential backoff)\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:426:log_info \"Creating WordPress post (status=$POST_STATUS, max $MAX_RETRIES attempts)...\"\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:594:log_info \"SUCCESS — WordPress post saved!\"\n./skills/wordpress/publish.sh:643:  bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/history/article_history.sh add \"$ACTIVE_URL\"\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:1:# Skill: wordpress\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:4:Publishes a crypto news article to WordPress as a **live** post (`status: publish` by default). Uploads the **feature image** only (no inline price charts), strips the writer META block from the body, converts markdown to **Gutenberg blocks** (same format as pasting into the default block editor), creates the post, then sets **Rank Math** SEO via `POST /wp-json/rankmath/v1/updateMeta`.\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:9:bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:12:All arguments are **optional** — excerpt, slug, keywords, and titles are read from `/tmp/crypto-article.md`. **Post title** = first `#` H1 in the article body. **SEO title** (META) goes to Rank Math only, not the WordPress post title or body headline.\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:19:4. **WordPress post** — `POST /wp/v2/posts` with **title = article H1** (visible headline above image; not SEO Title).\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:26:- **Narrow one-sided layout** on old API posts was caused by **raw HTML** in `content`. New publishes use **Gutenberg blocks** so layout matches manual paste in the default editor.\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:27:- Optional wp-admin: **Divi Post Settings → Layout → Fullwidth** for extra full-page width.\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:35:| `article_headline` | H1 used as WordPress post title |\n./skills/wordpress/SKILL.md:55:| Status | `publish` (use `--status draft` for review-first) |\n./skills/wordpress/html_to_gutenberg.py:2:\"\"\"Convert pandoc HTML to WordPress Gutenberg block-serialized content.\"\"\"\n./skills/wordpress/wp_post_actions.sh:2:# wp_post_actions.sh — Update existing WordPress posts (draft / content)\n./skills/wordpress/wp_post_actions.sh:6:#   bash wp_post_actions.sh --post-id 123 --set-status publish\n./skills/wordpress/wp_post_actions.sh:18:WP_API=\"${WP_URL}/wp-json/wp/v2\"\n./skills/wordpress/wp_post_actions.sh:100:    publish|draft|pending|future) ;;\n./TOOLS.md:1:# TOOLS.md — Scribe's WordPress Environment\n./TOOLS.md:3:This file contains the exact credentials and paths for publishing to WordPress. The `publish.sh` skill script embeds these values — this file is your reference.\n./TOOLS.md:7:## WordPress Site\n./TOOLS.md:12:| **API Base** | `https://slateblue-reindeer-775070.hostingersite.com/wp-json/wp/v2` |\n./TOOLS.md:16:| **Post Status** | `publish` (live). Use `--status draft` on the script for review-first. |\n./TOOLS.md:33:| `/tmp/wp-result.txt` | WordPress post URL on success |\n./TOOLS.md:41:~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh\n./TOOLS.md:46:bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh \\\n./TOOLS.md:61:| **This workspace** | `~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/` |\n./TOOLS.md:62:| **Agent sessions** | `~/.openclaw/agents/wp-publisher/sessions/` |\n./IDENTITY.md:4:- **Role:** WordPress Publisher\n./IDENTITY.md:6:- **Vibe:** Precise and reliable — gets the article live on WordPress and returns the exact post URL. Never invents a result.\n./SOUL.md:1:# SOUL.md — Scribe, the WordPress Publisher\n./SOUL.md:3:You are **Scribe** 🗞️, the WordPress publisher agent for a crypto news pipeline. You are called by the Orchestrator (Nexus) after the human has confirmed they want the article published to WordPress.\n./SOUL.md:10:2. **NEVER invent or guess a WordPress URL.** The only valid success output is what `cat /tmp/wp-result.txt` prints after the script exits 0.\n./SOUL.md:12:4. **Do not ask questions.** The article and image are already on disk. Just publish.\n./SOUL.md:16:## Step 1 — Publish to WordPress `[TOOL CALL REQUIRED]`\n./SOUL.md:20:I will now run the publish script. The script will auto-extract the title and excerpt from the article file — I do not need to pass them unless the message explicitly provides them.\n./SOUL.md:24:Run this **exact** command using your bash tool (default **live** publish — do not pass `--status draft` unless the Orchestrator explicitly asks):\n./SOUL.md:27:bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh\n./SOUL.md:33:bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh --title \"TITLE FROM MESSAGE\"\n./SOUL.md:39:bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh --status draft\n./SOUL.md:44:The script handles everything: image upload, HTML conversion, WordPress API call, retries, and validation.\n./SOUL.md:58:This prints the live WordPress post URL. Return it exactly.\n./SOUL.md:71:- The WordPress post URL (e.g. `https://slateblue-reindeer-775070.hostingersite.com/?p=123`)\n./USER.md:5:- **Role:** Running an autonomous crypto news publishing pipeline\n./USER.md:9:You are the **last step** in a human-confirmed publish flow:\n./USER.md:16:                                               Bhard says \"yes publish\"\n./USER.md:21:Your job: receive the publish instruction from the Orchestrator, run the skill script, and return the live WordPress draft URL.\n./USER.md:26:- **Reliability** — If publishing fails, report the exact error so Bhard can fix it.\n./USER.md:27:- **Speed** — The publish should be fast. Don't wait or ask questions.\n./USER.md:31:- Never ask clarifying questions. Just publish.","cwd":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779539436151}}
